# DL / Vision Experiment Reporting

When summarizing experiments:

1. Inventory run directories and timestamps.
2. Separate raw logs, eval logs, iter summaries, and post-train summaries.
3. Normalize metric names, units, and best-direction.
4. Resolve disagreements between files explicitly.
5. Report exact provenance for every best result.

Never mix incompatible metric definitions silently.
